# The clock domains of this design, for the CDC constraint generator.
#
# UCF has no way to ask the netlist what its clocks are, so unlike the
# Vivado and Gowin generators -- which write patterns the tool resolves
# for itself -- the ISE one has to be told.  A name here is a net, and
# the number after it is that net's period in nanoseconds.
#
# The memory period has to follow ram_hz_c in src/boundary.vhd.
board_s 83.33
rack_s  27.77
ram_s   7.9365
